# apps/web — build-time configuration. Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in.

# The ecosystem's client key for api.smartago.net. With it, the first run asks the geo endpoint
# `/api/multi/get-suggested-language-v2` which language this IP's country reads — the same call PLUI
# makes at boot, and the order ZUKKA uses (IP first, the device's own language second).
# Without it nothing breaks: every face simply falls back to the device's language.
# The value is the ecosystem's PUBLIC client key, the one that ships inside every Smartago app:
# see `Subscription.API_KEY` in Premium-Launcher-UI-Kotlin, or PUBLIC_CLIENT_SECRET in the web env.
VITE_GEO_API_KEY=
